          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete %@ and their linked cards and transaction history? This cannot be undone. A pass already saved on a phone may remain visible, but it will no longer work in Waffi. An anonymous copy of their Apple pass (no name, card or balance) is kept for 30 days so the pass on their phone can show as no longer valid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "حذف %@ وبطاقاته وسجل معاملاته؟ لا يمكن التراجع عن ذلك. قد تبقى البطاقة المحفوظة على الهاتف ظاهرة، لكنها لن تعمل في وافي. تُحفظ نسخة مجهولة من بطاقة محفظة Apple الخاصة به (دون اسم أو بطاقة أو رصيد) لمدة 30 يومًا حتى تظهر البطاقة على هاتفه على أنها لم تعد صالحة."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete %@ and their linked cards and transaction history? This cannot be undone. A pass already saved on a phone may remain visible, but it will no longer work in Waffi. An anonymous copy of their Apple pass (no name, card or balance) is kept for 30 days so the pass on their phone can show as no longer valid."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ has no card yet. This creates their card and a private link that opens it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ليس لدى %@ بطاقة بعد. سيُنشئ هذا بطاقته ورابطًا خاصًا يفتحها."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ has no card yet. This creates their card and a private link that opens it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This gives %@ a new private link to their card. The link they have now stops working, and so does their Apple pass, which shows as no longer valid; they can add a new one from the new link. Their points and card number stay the same.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "سيحصل %@ على رابط خاص جديد لبطاقته، ويتوقف الرابط الذي لديه الآن عن العمل، وكذلك بطاقة محفظة Apple الخاصة به وتظهر على أنها لم تعد صالحة؛ ويستطيع إضافة بطاقة جديدة من الرابط الجديد. تبقى نقاطه ورقم بطاقته كما هما."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This gives %@ a new private link to their card. The link they have now stops working, and so does their Apple pass, which shows as no longer valid; they can add a new one from the new link. Their points and card number stay the same."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create link": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
