            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Other offers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Birthday offers and Coupons are separate from loyalty Rewards. They do not spend the Card balance.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "عروض عيد الميلاد والقسائم منفصلة عن مكافآت الولاء، ولا تخصم من رصيد البطاقة."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Birthday offers and Coupons are separate from loyalty Rewards. They do not spend the Card balance."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No birthday offer available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لا يوجد عرض عيد ميلاد متاح."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No birthday offer available."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No active campaign coupons for this card.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لا توجد قسائم حملات نشطة لهذه البطاقة."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No active campaign coupons for this card."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@. Confirm only after providing this offer. This coupon can be redeemed once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@. أكد بعد تقديم العرض للعميل. يمكن استبدال هذه القسيمة مرة واحدة."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@. Confirm only after providing this offer. This coupon can be redeemed once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@. Hand over the complimentary item, then confirm. This offer can be redeemed once across the Business. It does not change stamps or Saved Gifts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@. سلّم الصنف المجاني ثم أكّد. يمكن استبدال هذا العرض مرة واحدة في النشاط التجاري كله، ولا يغيّر الأختام أو الهدايا المحفوظة."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@. Hand over the complimentary item, then confirm. This offer can be redeemed once across the Business. It does not change stamps or Saved Gifts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
